WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,860
next time we meet again

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,580
You have to be honest

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,260
Come live with me back to the community

4
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,460
Do you understand?

5
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:09,040
Don't worry, boss

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,660
See you next time

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:13,500
I will definitely take the initiative to live in your community

8
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,390
See you next time

9
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,150
You think I'm stupid

10
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,350
Leave this time

11
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,830
I'm sure I won't be able to find any trace of my escape.

12
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:23,230
Want to blackmail me, dream

13
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:26,420
Boss, then I’ll leave first.

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,220
Goodbye, see you next time

15
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:31,030
See you next time

16
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:33,060
See you big-headed ghost
